    <briefdescription>
<para>A collection of ground stations on the surface of a celestial body. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class manages and provides access to a set of ground stations, which can be used for communication, observation, or data collection.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>_body_</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The celestial body NTTP that all stations in this architecture reside on. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
